menu "RemoteCompose ThorVG renderer"

config KOBENTOVG_3D
    bool "3D operations (software rasterizer)"
    default y
    help
        Draw RemoteCompose's 3D operations (meshes, cameras, lights) with rccore's software
        rasterizer. It needs two full-screen buffers plus a snapshot per run of meshes, and
        it is slow on small chips. When off, 3D operations are skipped and documents/3d/ is
        not embedded.

endmenu
